                                                "sense_id": "5b5c9b94-de3c-3e35-b0a6-c98edc3cba7c",
                                                "text": "He went to the rail to spit out a scarlet mouthful of betel […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee951807-1281-4f34-9981-bc2cc7ce971b",
                                                "sense_id": "5b5c9b94-de3c-3e35-b0a6-c98edc3cba7c",
                                                "text": "Within the range of his powers, he sends her, secretly, […] cosmetics such as red lac, red arsenic, yellow arsenic, red mercury sulphide, and black collyrium; sandalwood paste and saffron; and, in course of time, areca nuts and betel leaves for betel."
                                            }
                                        ]
